{"id":"vod_sn_38461","vodId":"38461","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"死后文","name_cn":"死后文","date":"2008-01-01","year":"2008","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/800edb5f6086c245fdbe3ea766710b34.jpg"},"summary":"东京大街上的一角，某栋高楼的顶层废弃小屋中。町屋翔太正在制作梦想中的火炬，而他的朋友绫瀬明日奈的父亲的尸体，出现在了这座大厦。警察的调查没有什么结果。但第2天一位白发少女给翔太送来了明日奈的父亲写给翔太的“死后文”——死去的人留给生者世界的信息。而送信来的少女，自称文歌。死后文的内容是什么？是对尘世的思念，还是对生者的嘱咐？一封封“死后文”，引出了一段段人间悲剧。而送信少女文歌，似乎也隐藏着不可告人的秘密。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:01:42","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/LQnXe94iYE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uZ0MzXBKqU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/73vsF73cXc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tJv4P1Ucwq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VXbKvC3TV91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kB9SMeCvTg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ufy7Bsv0ai1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hj2yzAF9Kt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sGrCePi9Jw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8fg3Y5ERTU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wmUzrHxDuc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kYhxcWbVP51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VKmm2Pp4Yj1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:58.556Z"}